Sval: Remove the synced tabs sidebar

The synced tabs sidebar listed tabs from a Firefox account, and Firefox
accounts are locked off, so it could only ask the user to sign in. The
component goes with the sidebar panel, switcher item, context menus and
all-tabs menu button that opened it, the revamped sidebar's panel for
it, its strings and tests. WebRTC's indicator used the component's
event emitter and takes toolkit's, which passes the event name first.

